description:
Central world state manager as a GenServer.

Responsibilities:
- Maintains registry of all nodes (emitters, collectors, transformers, passives)
- Tracks active tokenes in the world
- Environment config (gravity vector, global settings)
- Logic tick at configurable rate (default 30hz)
- Event dispatch: emit, absorb, split, fuse, trigger
- Node CRUD operations
- Publishes state diffs to connected clients via PubSub

State shape:
  %World{
    id: uuid,
    name: string,
    nodes: %{id => Node.t()},
    tokenes: %{id => Tokene.t()},
    environment: %Environment{gravity: {x, y}, tick_rate: 30},
    tick_count: integer
  }

Events pushed to client:
- {:emit, emitter_id, [tokene]}
- {:absorb, collector_id, tokene_id}
- {:split, tokene_id, [new_tokenes]}
- {:fuse, [tokene_ids], new_tokene}
- {:trigger, collector_id, output}
- {:node_added | :node_removed | :node_updated, node}
